ra_Rod_720f3f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a terra rod.<br/>Classification: 1 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by druids of level 26 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 25.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Small stones are flying from its tip.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>An upgrade from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Necrotic%20Rod\">Necrotic Rod</a> and the Northwind Rod, that, however, does not makes them both obsolete, since earth is widely considered to be the worst element, as a lot of monsters are immune to it. It is the <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">druid</a>'s equivalent of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">sorcerer</a>'s <a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Cosmic%20Energy\">Wand of Cosmic Energy</a>. Terra Rods replaced Quagmire Rods in the Winter Update 2007, which in turn replaced <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wooden%20Wand\"><img alt=\"Wooden Wand\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wooden_Wand_ed6085.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Wooden%20Wand\">Wooden Wands</a> in the Winter Update 2005.\nNeeded for <a href=\"#/quest/mage-outfits-quest\">Mage Outfits Quest</a> (male) and <a href=\"#/quest/summoner-outfits-quest\">Summoner Outfits Quest</a> (female).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Mana Gain on Hit\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+5 mana on hit</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Earth Critical Extra Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110318&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Critical_Extra_Damage_Element_bc18f4.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+5% critical extra damage for Earth spells and runes</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Rune Critical Extra Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+3% critical extra damage for offensive runes</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weap